  "markdown": "# Peta Learning Outcomes dan Cara Belajar\n\n> [!info] Sumber: syllabus resmi Binusmaya (LMS), dibaca 20 Oktober 2026\n> MKTG6322005, kelas LB21, 4 SKS. Dosen: Prof. Idris Gautama So (syllabus); materi oleh Aryo Bismo. Buku: Buttle dan Maklan (2019) *Customer Relationship Management Concepts and Technologies*; Hunt, Deitz, Hansen (2024) *Professional Selling*.\n\n## Penilaian\n| Komponen | Bobot | AI |\n|---|---|---|\n| Assignment | 20% | Flexible |\n| Mid project | 30% | Partial |\n| Final project | 30% | Integrated |\n| **Quiz** | 20% | **Independent (tanpa AI)** |\n\nQuiz adalah bagian yang paling mirip ujian tertulis; ringkasan ini terutama untuk quiz.\n\n## 4 Learning Outcome\n| LO | Level | Isi |\n|---|---|---|\n| LO1 | C2 Comprehension | Pahami prinsip, proses, dan strategi professional selling dan CRM di konteks B2B dan B2C (indikator: tahap customer journey acquisition, retention, development; evolusi perilaku pelanggan di tiap tahap) |\n| LO2 | C3 Application | Terapkan teknik sales dan strategi komunikasi untuk mengenali kebutuhan pelanggan dan menangani keberatan (presentasi lewat tulisan, lisan, visual) |\n| LO3 | C4 Analysis | Analisis perilaku pelanggan, kualitas hubungan, dan data CRM untuk mengevaluasi nilai pelanggan (komponen CRM strategis, operasional, analitis) |\n| LO4 | C5 Synthesis | Buat rencana CRM atau strategi sales yang memadukan alat CRM, wawasan pelanggan, dan teknik membangun hubungan |\n\n## Peta sesi\n| Sesi | Judul | LO |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Everyone is a Salesperson | LO1 |\n| 2 | Engaging Customers and Developing Relationships | LO1, LO2 |\n| 3 | Prospecting and Qualifying (Part 1) | LO2 |\n| 4 | Prospecting and Qualifying (Part 2) | LO2 |\n| 5 | Social Selling | LO2 |\n| 6 | Sales Presentation Strategies | LO2 |\n| 7 | Sales Negotiations (Part 1) | LO2 |\n| 8 | Sales Negotiations (Part 2) | LO2 |\n| 9 | Profitology: Pricing and Analytics in Sales (Part 1) | LO3 |\n| 10 | Profitology: Pricing and Analytics in Sales (Part 2); materi di LMS berjudul Solving Problems and Overcoming Objections | LO2, LO3 |\n| 11-12 | The Psychology of Selling: Knowing Yourself and Relating to Customers | LO1, LO2 |\n\n> [!warning] Belum tercakup\n> Bagian CRM (komponen strategis, operasional, analitis; customer journey; data CRM) belum ada filenya di LMS, jadi belum ada di aplikasi. Kirim bila dosen sudah upload."
